 Austria, Luxembourg, and the Netherlands under the k kiosk, Brezelk\u00f6nig, BackWerk, Ditsch, Press & Books, avec, Caff\u00e8 Spettacolo, and ok.\u0096 brands. Fomento Econ\u00f3mico Mexicano, S.A.B. de C.V. was founded in 1890 and is headquartered in Monterrey, Mexico."}}